# IORISphere agent scaffolding. Excluded by choice: this repo publishes a public
# website, and the agent's control plane is not part of the site. Consequence to be
# aware of -- the handoffs under .iorisphere/handoffs/ are the agent's durable memory,
# so this machine now holds the only copy and they will not survive a fresh clone.
AGENTS.md
.iorisphere/
.github/workflows/iorisphere.yml

# Tool-specific instruction files (Claude Code, Cline, GitHub Copilot)
CLAUDE.md
.clinerules/
.github/copilot-instructions.md
